    "body":  "Closes #820\n\nAdds the Sentry service connection to the catalog so agents can inspect and debug issues, errors, stack traces, and releases.\n\n### Changes\n- Author connection manifest at `core/switch_core/connections/catalog/sentry/connection.yaml` with OAuth 2.0, dynamic client registration, and loopback redirects\n- Author skill documentation at `core/switch_core/connections/catalog/sentry/skill/SKILL.md`\n- Add Sentry mark `sentry.svg`, brand color token (`#FB4226`) in `connection-icon.tsx`, and attribution entry in `NOTICE.md`\n- Add cross-platform CRLF compatibility in `core/switch_core/connections/loader.py`\n- Add catalog entry test in `core/tests/switch_core/connections/test_loader.py`\n\n### Testing\n- `uv run pytest core/tests/switch_core/connections/test_loader.py -k \"sentry\"` passed (0.81s)\n- `uv run ruff check` \u0026 `ruff format --check` passed\n",
